#: src/app/web/templates/home.html:65
msgid ""
"Every Japanese ticket is a <b>campaign</b>, not a date — fan-club "
"presale, lottery\n"
"      round 1, round 2 if you lose, a first-come sale, an upgrade round "
"riding on the\n"
"      seat you already hold. We track the whole ladder and tell you "
"exactly where you stand."
msgstr ""
"日本的每一张票都是一场<b>战役</b>，而不只是一个日期 — "
"后援会先行、抽选第一轮、落选后的第二轮、先到先得的发售、依托你已有座位的升级抽选。我们追踪整条阶梯，并准确告诉你现在处于哪一步。"

#: src/app/web/templates/home.html:71
msgid "Free · we DM you on Discord · no card, no spam"
msgstr "免费 · 我们通过 Discord 私信你 · 无需绑卡，绝无骚扰"

#: src/app/web/templates/home.html:74
