"Tap a franchise, a group, or one performer. New events for anyone you "
"follow\n"
"          show up on your board <b>automatically</b>."
msgstr "点选一个系列、一个组合，或某一位表演者。你关注对象的新活动会<b>自动</b>出现在你的看板上。"

