msgid "We track every round's deadline"
msgstr "我们追踪每一轮的截止"

#: src/app/web/templates/home.html:93
msgid ""
"Presale opens, lottery closes, results land, payment is due. All times "
"shown\n"
"          <b>JST and yours</b>, always both — no mental arithmetic at 3am."
msgstr "先行开放、抽选截止、结果公布、付款截止。所有时间都<b>同时以 JST 和你的时间</b>显示，永远两者兼备 — 无需在凌晨三点心算。"

