#: src/app/web/templates/terms.html:12
msgid ""
"These are the terms for using dekimasen.app. By signing in you agree to\n"
"    them. They are short on purpose: this is a free hobby project, not a\n"
"    company, and the honest version fits on one page. How your data is\n"
"    handled is a separate page — see the\n"
"    <a href=\"/privacy\">privacy policy</a>."
msgstr ""
"这是使用 dekimasen.app "
"的条款。登录即表示你同意它们。它们特意写得很短：这是一个免费的业余项目，不是一家公司，如实的版本一页就够了。你的数据如何处理是另一页 — 见<a "
"href=\"/privacy\">隐私政策</a>。"

#: src/app/web/templates/terms.html:19
msgid "What this is"
msgstr "这是什么"

#: src/app/web/templates/terms.html:21
msgid ""
"dekimasen.app tracks deadlines for Japanese concerts — lottery rounds,\n"
"    serial-code sales, stream tickets — and sends you a Discord DM before"
"\n"
"    the ones you follow close. It is run by one person, for free, on a\n"
"    best-effort basis. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or "
"operated\n"
"    on behalf of Discord, any artist, agency, venue, promoter, or "
"ticketing\n"
"    operator. Names and events listed here belong to the people who run\n"
"    them; this site only points at their deadlines."
msgstr ""
"dekimasen.app 追踪日本演出的截止 — 抽选、序列码发售、直播票 — 并在你关注的截止到来前给你发送 Discord "
"私信。它由一个人免费、尽力而为地运营。它与 "
"Discord，以及任何艺人、经纪公司、场馆、主办方或票务运营商均无隶属、背书或代运营关系。此处列出的名称和活动归运营它们的人所有；本站只是指向它们的截止。"

#: src/app/web/templates/terms.html:30
msgid "Who can use it"
msgstr "谁可以使用"

#: src/app/web/templates/terms.html:32
msgid ""
"You need a Discord account to sign in, and you must meet Discord's\n"
"    minimum age requirement for your country. Discord's own terms apply "
"to\n"
"    you alongside these ones — nothing here overrides them."
msgstr ""
"你需要一个 Discord 账号才能登录，并且必须达到 Discord 针对你所在国家/地区的最低年龄要求。Discord "
"自己的条款与这些条款一并适用于你 — 这里的任何内容都不会推翻它们。"

#: src/app/web/templates/terms.html:37
msgid "No guarantees"
msgstr "不作任何保证"

#: src/app/web/templates/terms.html:39
msgid ""
"This is the part that matters, so it is stated plainly: the service is\n"
"    provided as is, with no warranty of any kind. There is no promise "
"that\n"
"    a reminder arrives on time, that it arrives at all, or that the "
"deadline\n"
"    it refers to is correct."
msgstr "这是最要紧的部分，所以直说：本服务按现状提供，不附带任何形式的保证。不保证提醒会准时到达、会到达，或它所指的截止是正确的。"

#: src/app/web/templates/terms.html:45
msgid ""
"All three fail in ordinary use. Discord can refuse or delay a DM. The\n"
"    server can be down, and the scheduler can miss a tick. An editor can\n"
"    type the wrong date, or a promoter can move one after it was entered."
"\n"
"    Treat what you see here as a prompt to go and check, never as the\n"
"    authority. You are responsible for confirming every deadline you care"
"\n"
"    about with the official source before you rely on it."
msgstr ""
"这三者在日常使用中都会发生。Discord "
"可能拒绝或延迟一条私信。服务器可能宕机，调度器可能漏掉一次运行。编辑者可能打错日期，主办方也可能在录入之后改动它。请把你在这里看到的当作去核实的提示，而绝不要当作权威。在你依赖每一个你在意的截止之前，核实它是你自己的责任"
" — 以官方来源为准。"

#: src/app/web/templates/terms.html:53
msgid "Limitation of liability"
msgstr "责任限制"

#: src/app/web/templates/terms.html:55
msgid ""
"To the extent the law allows, the operator is not liable for any loss\n"
"    arising from your use of the service — a missed deadline, a missed\n"
"    lottery, a ticket you did not get, or anything downstream of those.\n"
"    This is a free service given away as a convenience; it comes with no\n"
"    money and no guarantees attached."
msgstr ""
"在法律允许的范围内，运营者对你使用本服务所引起的任何损失概不负责 — "
"错过的截止、落空的抽选、没拿到的票，或这些的任何后续影响。这是一项作为便利而免费赠予的服务；它不附带任何金钱，也不附带任何保证。"

#: src/app/web/templates/terms.html:62
msgid "Acceptable use"
msgstr "可接受的使用"

#: src/app/web/templates/terms.html:64
msgid "Do not scrape the site or send automated traffic at it."
msgstr "不要抓取本站，也不要向它发送自动化流量。"

#: src/app/web/templates/terms.html:66
msgid ""
"Do not attempt to break it, disrupt it, or reach data or accounts that\n"
"      are not yours."
msgstr "不要试图破坏它、扰乱它，或访问不属于你的数据或账户。"

#: src/app/web/templates/terms.html:70
msgid ""
"If you have editor rights, use them in good faith: add real events,\n"
"      keep entries accurate, and do not vandalise or spam the catalogue."
msgstr "如果你拥有编辑权限，请本着善意使用：添加真实的活动，保持条目准确，不要破坏或向目录灌水。"

#: src/app/web/templates/terms.html:75
msgid "Editor contributions"
msgstr "编辑者的贡献"

#: src/app/web/templates/terms.html:77
msgid ""
"Concerts, tags, and edits made by an editor go into a shared catalogue\n"
"    that everyone on the site uses. That content stays even if you stop\n"
"    using the service or ask for your account to be deleted — only your\n"
"    name is removed from it, so the events other people are following do\n"
"    not disappear because one person left. By contributing you agree to\n"
"    that arrangement. The\n"
"    <a href=\"/privacy\">privacy policy</a> says the same thing from the "
"data\n"
"    side."
msgstr ""
"编辑者创建的演出、标签和编辑会进入一个站上所有人都在用的共享目录。即使你不再使用本服务或要求删除账户，那些内容也会保留 — "
"只会从中移除你的名字，好让大家都在关注的活动不会因为一个人离开而消失。通过贡献内容，你即同意这一安排。<a "
"href=\"/privacy\">隐私政策</a>从数据的角度说的是同一件事。"

#: src/app/web/templates/terms.html:87
msgid "Availability and shutdown"
msgstr "可用性与关停"

#: src/app/web/templates/terms.html:89
msgid ""
"The service may change, break, or shut down at any time, with or without\n"
"    notice. Access may be withdrawn from anyone who abuses it or breaks\n"
"    these terms. You can stop using it whenever you like."
msgstr "本服务可能随时更改、中断或关停，无论是否事先通知。对滥用它或违反这些条款的任何人，其访问权限可能被撤回。你可以随时停止使用它。"

#: src/app/web/templates/terms.html:94
msgid "Changes to these terms"
msgstr "这些条款的变更"

#: src/app/web/templates/terms.html:96
msgid ""
"If these terms change, the date at the top of this page changes with\n"
"    them. Continuing to use the service after that means you accept the "
"new\n"
"    version."
msgstr "如果这些条款发生变更，本页顶部的日期也会随之更改。此后继续使用本服务即表示你接受新版本。"

#: src/app/web/templates/terms.html:101
msgid "Governing law"
msgstr "适用法律"

#: src/app/web/templates/terms.html:103
msgid ""
"These terms are governed by the laws of the Province of New Brunswick\n"
"    and the federal laws of Canada applicable therein."
msgstr "这些条款受新不伦瑞克省法律及适用于该省的加拿大联邦法律管辖。"

#: src/app/web/templates/terms.html:107
msgid "Contact"
msgstr "联系方式"

#: src/app/web/templates/terms.html:108
msgid "Questions about any of this:"
msgstr "有关这些的任何问题："

#: src/app/web/templates/terms.html:130
msgid ""
"tl;dr: it's a helpful reminder tool built by a fan, not a ticket broker.\n"
"    Double-check the official page before every deadline."
msgstr "一句话：这是一个粉丝做的实用提醒工具，不是票务中介。每个截止前请再核对官方页面。"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:2
msgid "welcome"
msgstr "欢迎"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:8
msgid "Calendar"
msgstr "日历"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:13
msgid "Skip setup entirely"
msgstr "完全跳过设置"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:19
msgid "Follow some artists"
msgstr "关注一些艺人"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:20
msgid ""
"Get a DM the moment a new event drops for anyone you follow. Pick a "
"franchise to cover\n"
"    everyone under it, a group, or a single performer — you can change "
"any of this later. Tap\n"
"    to follow."
msgstr "你关注的任何人一有新活动，你就会立刻收到私信。选一个系列以覆盖其下所有人、一个组合，或某一位表演者 — 这些之后都能随时更改。点击即可关注。"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:25
msgid "Search franchises, groups, performers…"
msgstr "搜索系列、组合、表演者…"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:26
msgid "Search tags"
msgstr "搜索标签"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:34
msgid "Following — click to unfollow"
msgstr "关注中 — 点击以取消关注"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:83
#, python-format
msgid "<b>%(count)s</b> tag followed"
msgid_plural "<b>%(count)s</b> tags followed"
msgstr[0] "关注了 <b>%(count)s</b> 个标签"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:91
msgid "Pick a default reminder preset"
msgstr "选择一个默认提醒预设"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:92
msgid ""
"This is what fires when you tap \"Set my reminders\" on a concert, or "
"press the Discord DM\n"
"    button — a standard loadout you won't have to rebuild every time. "
"Rules on a single concert\n"
"    always override it."
msgstr ""
"当你在某场演出上点击“设置我的提醒”，或按下 Discord 私信按钮时，触发的就是这个 — "
"一套无需每次重建的标准配置。单场演出上的规则始终会覆盖它。"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:105
msgid "Light touch"
msgstr "轻量"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:106
msgid "Relaxed"
msgstr "轻松"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:108
#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:122
msgid "Opens — when applications open"
msgstr "开放 — 申请开放时"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:109
msgid "Closes — 1 day before"
msgstr "截止 — 提前 1 天"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:110
#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:124
#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:135
msgid "Results — when results come out"
msgstr "结果 — 结果公布时"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:111
msgid "Payment — when payment is due"
msgstr "付款 — 到付款截止时"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:116
msgid "Balanced"
msgstr "均衡"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:118
msgid "Standard"
msgstr "标准"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:119
msgid "Recommended"
msgstr "推荐"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:123
msgid "Closes — 3 days &amp; 1 day before"
msgstr "截止 — 提前 3 天 &amp; 1 天"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:125
msgid "Payment — 1 day before"
msgstr "付款 — 提前 1 天"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:130
msgid "Maximum coverage"
msgstr "最大覆盖"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:131
msgid "On the ball"
msgstr "万无一失"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:133
msgid "Opens — 1 day before &amp; when applications open"
msgstr "开放 — 提前 1 天 &amp; 申请开放时"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:134
msgid "Closes — 5, 3 &amp; 1 days before"
msgstr "截止 — 提前 5、3 &amp; 1 天"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:136
msgid "Payment — 3 &amp; 1 days before"
msgstr "付款 — 提前 3 &amp; 1 天"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:141
msgid ""
"One reminder for each single moment — opens, results, payment — plus a\n"
"    couple of nudges before closes, since that's the one with an action "
"to take. Fine-tune any of\n"
"    these below, or later in Preferences."
msgstr ""
"每个单一时刻各一条提醒 — 开放、结果、付款 — "
"外加临近截止前的几次提醒，因为那是唯一需要采取行动的。你可以在下面，或之后在偏好设置里，微调其中任何一项。"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:150
msgid "Offset"
msgstr "偏移"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:153
msgid "Before or after"
msgstr "之前或之后"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:157
msgid "Anchor"
msgstr "锚点"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:161
msgid "Remove this reminder"
msgstr "删除此提醒"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:167
msgid "Fine-tune these reminders"
msgstr "微调这些提醒"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:168
msgid "Change any dropdown — each row stays a real sentence."
msgstr "更改任一下拉框 — 每一行都保持为一句完整的话。"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:176
msgid "+ Add a reminder"
msgstr "+ 添加提醒"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:181
msgid "Rules on a single concert always override this."
msgstr "单场演出上的规则始终会覆盖它。"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:182
msgid "Skip this step"
msgstr "跳过此步"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:183
msgid "Create preset &amp; continue"
msgstr "创建预设并继续"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:353
msgid "Confirm your timezone"
msgstr "确认你的时区"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:354
msgid ""
"Deadlines always show JST first, then this timezone — so you never have "
"to convert a\n"
"    23:59 JST close in your head."
msgstr "截止总是先显示 JST，再显示这个时区 — 这样你就不用在脑子里换算一个 23:59 JST 的截止。"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:358
#, python-format
msgid "Detected <strong>%(tz)s</strong>"
msgstr "已检测到 <strong>%(tz)s</strong>"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:359
msgid "(auto-detected from your browser)"
msgstr "（从你的浏览器自动检测）"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:379
msgid "Use this timezone"
msgstr "使用此时区"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:427
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Right now that reads\n"
"  <span class=\"num\">%(tz_preview)s</span> for you."
msgstr ""
"现在对你来说，它显示为\n"
"  <span class=\"num\">%(tz_preview)s</span>。"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:432
msgid "Looks right, continue"
msgstr "看起来没错，继续"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:440
msgid ""
"Confirm reminders can actually reach you on Discord before you rely on "
"them. If your DMs\n"
"    are closed, this is where you find out — not the night a lottery "
"closes."
msgstr "在你依赖它们之前，先确认提醒确实能在 Discord 上送达你。如果你的私信是关闭的，就在这里发现 — 而不是在某个抽选截止的夜晚。"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:446
msgid "Send test DM"
msgstr "发送测试私信"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:455
msgid ""
"✅ <b>Test reminder.</b> If you can read this, your deadline DMs will "
"reach you — you'll\n"
"      get messages like a presale closing in 3 days, with the time in JST"
" and your own zone."
msgstr ""
"✅ <b>测试提醒。</b>如果你能读到这条，你的截止私信就能送达你 — 你会收到诸如“某先行将在 3 天后截止”的消息，并附上 JST "
"和你自己时区的时间。"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:461
msgid ""
"The Discord bot isn't running in this environment\n"
"  (dev mode), so DMs can't be tested here."
msgstr ""
"此环境中未运行 Discord 机器人\n"
"  （开发模式），所以无法在此测试私信。"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:474
msgid "Get your calendar feed"
msgstr "获取你的日历订阅"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:475
msgid ""
"Subscribe once in your phone or calendar app and every deadline you have "
"a reminder for\n"
"    stays in sync automatically — a belt to the DM's braces."
msgstr "在你的手机或日历应用里订阅一次，你设置了提醒的每个截止都会自动保持同步 — 给私信上一道双保险。"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:481
msgid "✓ Your feed link is ready — save it now, it won't be shown again."
msgstr "✓ 你的订阅链接已就绪 — 请立即保存，它不会再次显示。"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:486
msgid "Add it in Google Calendar, Apple Calendar, or Outlook."
msgstr "在 Google 日历、Apple 日历或 Outlook 中添加它。"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:490
msgid "Your feed is active."
msgstr "你的订阅已启用。"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:500
msgid "You're set — next we'll tidy up which concerts you're actually going for."
msgstr "你已就绪 — 接下来我们会整理一下你实际打算去的演出。"

#: src/app/web/templates/welcome.html:501
msgid "Continue to my concerts"
msgstr "前往我的演出"

